TI  - Complete Genome Sequence of Pseudomonas aeruginosa Phage-Resistant Variant PA1RG.
AB  - Bacteria have evolved several defense systems against phage predation. Here, we report the 6,500,439-bp complete genome sequence of the Pseudomonas aeruginosa phage-resistant variant PA1RG. Single-molecule real-time (SMRT) sequencing and de novo assembly revealed a single contig with 320-fold sequence coverage.
