TI  - Bacteriophage's Dualism in Therapy.
AB  - Careful selection of bacteriophages for phage therapy is needed to avoid undesirable consequences. Different approaches to phage therapy are compared: from the use of multispecies industrially produced phage mixtures with wide range of antibacterial activity to the 'magistral phage' approach in which bacteriophages are selected for treating individual patients.
